    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Because it's not a 'fairytale' until a fairy tells it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate's Theater is a card-based storyteller where two mischievous fairies (sparkling Fortune and velvet-dark Misfortune) compete to toy with mortal fates. Enchant your living cards, combine their destinies, and make secret wagers to determine whether your mortals experience delightful serendipity or become unwitting characters in wickedly amusing catastrophes \u2014 always in perfect rhyme!   <br>   <br><strong><i>\u201cWhere mortal fates take wicked swings,</i></strong>   <br><strong><i>You choose which fairy pulls the strings!\u201d</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Cosmic Tug-of-War</strong> \u2014 Shift mortal fates between delightful fortune and wicked misfortune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely Combine Cards</strong> \u2014 Experiment with card combinations to discover 400+ hand-crafted micro-stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Outcome Narratives</strong> \u2014 Each micro-story concludes differently depending on the winning fairy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhymes &amp; Mischief</strong> \u2014 Every fate revealed through playful verses, making mischief deliciously poetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Rules, Strategic Bets</strong> \u2014 Easy-to-learn mechanics with secretive wagers to tip fate's scales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive Ambience</strong> \u2014 Background hues and music dynamically shift with each fairy's triumph.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Shadow Puppets</strong> \u2014 Adorable silhouetted characters in charming shadow theater aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Duels, Solo or Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Short, narrative-rich matches playable alone or with a friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsy &amp; Wickedness</strong> \u2014 Equal parts cute and macabre, balancing playful charm with dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cFortune's kiss, Misfortune's curse,</i></strong><br><strong><i>Who gets to write the final verse?\u201d</i></strong></p>",
