ith a friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsy &amp; Wickedness</strong> \u2014 Equal parts cute and macabre, balancing playful charm with dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cFortune's kiss, Misfortune's curse,</i></strong><br><strong><i>Who gets to write the final verse?\u201d</i></strong></p>",
